<h4 class="c-tit02"><span>Eligibility Criteria</span></h4>
<ul class="detail-list">
<li style="list-style-type: none;">
<ul class="detail-list">
<li style="list-style-type: none;">
<ul class="c-list01">
<li><span class="tit">A prospective international applicant</span><br />(1) must be a non-Korean, <br />(2) must either hold or be expected to hold a high school diploma or a certificate of high school equivalency (e.g. GED), and <br />(3) must have obtained at least TOPIK (Test of Proficiency in Korean) score of at least level 3 or Kyungsung TOPIK Score of at least level 4.</li>
<li><span class="tit">For a transfer prospective international student</span><br />(1) 2nd Year Transfer &ndash; obtained at least 33 credits the first year of school at a 4-year university located in Republic of Korea (or) overseas.<br />(2) 3rd Year Transfer &ndash; obtained at least 65 credits the first 2 years (4 semesters) of school at a 4-year university (or) hold or be expected to hold an associate degree.</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<div class="sec-sgap"></div>
<h4 class="c-tit02"><span>Scholarship for Korean Track Undergraduate Program</span></h4>
<ul class="detail-list">
<li style="list-style-type: none;">
<ul class="detail-list">
<li style="list-style-type: none;">
<ul class="c-list01">
<li><span class="tit">First Semester(based on Korean Proficiency Score) </span><br />
<table width="100%" class="tbl-type01 ">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="background-color: #e6eef7;"><span style="color: #000000;"><strong>Status</strong></span></td>
<td style="background-color: #e6eef7;"><span style="color: #000000;"><strong>Type</strong></span></td>
<td style="background-color: #e6eef7;"><span style="color: #000000;"><strong>Student</strong></span></td>
<td style="background-color: #e6eef7;"><span style="color: #000000;"><strong>Scholarship<br />(Tuition Fee Waiver)<br /></strong></span></td>
<td style="background-color: #e6eef7;"><span style="color: #000000;"><strong>Criteria</strong></span></td>
<td style="background-color: #e6eef7;"><span style="color: #000000;"><strong>Remarks</strong></span></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: center;" rowspan="5">First-year<br />and<br />Transfer</td>
<td style="text-align: center;" rowspan="4">Tuition<br />Fee<br />Waiver</td>
<td style="text-align: center;">Korean<br />and<br />English<br />Tracks</td>
<td>100%<br />(Special Selected Scholar)</td>
<td>
<p style="text-align: left;">- A special selected scholar by overseas sister university based on the MOU/agreement</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">- A special selected scholar by Yayasan Kyungsung Indonesia based on his/her qualified academic performance during the language training period (selects within 10% of Yayasan Kyungsung Indonesia from the number of student admission)</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">- A special selected scholar based on the highest score of the admission evaluation process among a holder of at least Test of Proficiency in Korean (TOPIK) level 5 for Korean Track admission, a holder of at least TOEFL iBT 79 or at least IELTS 6.0 or holds the nationality of a country that uses English as its mother tongue or uses English as a legal official language for English Track admission</p>
<p><br /><br /></p>
</td>
<td>
<p style="text-align: left;">Among a special selected</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">scholar who qualifies for one</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">of the three criteria shall be</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">finally chosen,</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">and a limited number of</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">applicant(s) per semester</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">shall be finally chosen</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">based on the current</p>
